title: The Council
subtitle: Change the advisors you are listening to.
is-pinned-card: true
card-image: img/cards/council.svg?v=2
tags: advisor
new-page: true
view-if: adv_reserve >= 1 and council_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.syncAdvisors(Q);
!}

= The Council

You listen to four advisors at a time; the others wait in the corridor. Each advisor offers one action. Changing the council takes a turn, and it cannot be done again for three months.

*Advising now: [+ council_list +].* *In reserve: [+ reserve_list +].*

- @shuffle: Draw a new council at random.
- @bring_martov: Call on Julius Martov.
- @bring_dan: Call on Fyodor Dan.
- @bring_tsereteli: Call on Irakli Tsereteli.
- @bring_chkheidze: Call on Nikolai Chkheidze.
- @bring_skobelev: Call on Matvei Skobelev.
- @bring_gvozdev: Call on Kuzma Gvozdev.
- @bring_potresov: Call on Alexander Potresov.
- @bring_axelrod: Call on Pavel Axelrod.
- @bring_abramovich: Call on Raphael Abramovich.
- @bring_liber: Call on Mikhail Liber.
- @bring_broido: Call on Eva Broido.
- @bring_lidia: Call on Lidia Dan.
- @bring_sukhanov: Call on Nikolai Sukhanov.
- @bring_batursky: Call on Boris Batursky.
- @bring_khinchuk: Call on Lev Khinchuk.
- @bring_zhordania: Call on Noe Zhordania.
- @bring_chernov: Call on Viktor Chernov.
- @bring_avksentiev: Call on Nikolai Avksentiev.
- @bring_breshkovskaya: Call on Ekaterina Breshko-Breshkovskaya.
- @bring_gots: Call on Abram Gots.
- @bring_zenzinov: Call on Vladimir Zenzinov.
- @bring_volsky: Call on Vladimir Volsky.
- @bring_spiridonova: Call on Maria Spiridonova.
- @bring_kamkov: Call on Boris Kamkov.
- @bring_natanson: Call on Mark Natanson.
- @bring_steinberg: Call on Isaac Steinberg.
- @bring_kolegaev: Call on Andrei Kolegaev.
- @bring_proshian: Call on Prosh Proshian.
- @bring_aleksandrovich: Call on Pyotr Aleksandrovich.
- @drop_martov: Replace Julius Martov.
- @drop_dan: Replace Fyodor Dan.
- @drop_tsereteli: Replace Irakli Tsereteli.
- @drop_chkheidze: Replace Nikolai Chkheidze.
- @drop_skobelev: Replace Matvei Skobelev.
- @drop_gvozdev: Replace Kuzma Gvozdev.
- @drop_potresov: Replace Alexander Potresov.
- @drop_axelrod: Replace Pavel Axelrod.
