- @drop_avksentiev: Replace Nikolai Avksentiev.
- @drop_breshkovskaya: Replace Ekaterina Breshko-Breshkovskaya.
- @drop_gots: Replace Abram Gots.
- @drop_zenzinov: Replace Vladimir Zenzinov.
