@shuffle
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1; Q.council_timer = 3;
RO.reshuffleCouncil(Q);
!}

The advisors were thanked and sent home, and a new circle was called together.

- @root: Continue.

@bring_martov
view-if: avail_martov = 1 and on_martov = 0
subtitle: Offers: All-Socialist Government (Martov opens talks with the SRs, Left SRs and moderate Bolsheviks)
on-arrival: {!
Q.adv_in = 'martov';
Q.adv_in_name = "Julius Martov";
!}

