subtitle: Offers: Jewish Workers' Link (Liber rallies the Jewish workers' organisations)
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1; Q.council_timer = 3;
RO.swapAdvisor(Q, 'liber', Q.adv_out);
!}

[+ adv_out_name +] has stepped down from the council, and Mikhail Liber has taken the seat.

- @root: Continue.

